### API
Contains FastAPI route handlers. 
These handle incoming HTTP requests, parse request parameters, and return JSON responses.
Remember to use VALID HTTP ERROR CODES!

## Expected Files
``hotels.py``   - Hotels & Rooms
``bookings.py`` - Tickets & Reservations
``auth.py``     - Login & Signup
``router.py``   - Combine above to make Master API Router

